# 🧠 Common Beginner Mistakes

❌ Believing ethical hacking means "hacking anything."

❌ Skipping planning and authorization.

❌ Ignoring legal requirements.

❌ Focusing only on tools instead of methodology.

❌ Forgetting to document findings.

